    "gold": "24",
    "question": "Tayzia and her two young daughters get haircuts.  Women\u2019s haircuts are $48.  Children\u2019s haircuts are $36.  If Tayzia wants to give a 20% tip to the hair stylist, how much would it be?",
    "question_sha256": "6dbcd03c1db661dc4d78a6f3d6c81c5c1727dc8a105857dbbf8178251f6048c6",
