        ],
        "student_prefix_sha256": "27a930fe5971619b0809a15bbb8e58aaeb87bd4e0c2473f494d4458894e4a2c0",
        "target": "First, I identify the given quantities:\n- Women\u2019s haircut cost: $48\n- Children\u2019s haircut cost: $36\n- Number of women: 1\n- Number of children: 2\n- Tip percentage: 20%\n\nNext, I calculate the total cost of the haircuts:\n- Total cost for women: 1 * $48 = $48\n- Total cost for children: 2 * $36 = $72\n- Total cost for all: $48 + $72 = $120\n\nNow, I calculate the 20% tip:\n- 20% of $120 = 0.20 * $120 = $24\n\nSo, the tip amount is $24.\n\nFINAL: 24",
